2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Verification\040of\040a\040six\055degree\040of\040freedom\040simulation\040model\040for\040the\040REMUS\040autonomous\040underwater\040vehicle)
/Author (Timothy\040Prestero)
/Subject (Improving\040the\040performance\040of\040modular\054\040low\055cost\040autonomous\040underwater\040vehicles\040\050AUVs\051\040in\040such\040applications\040as\040long\055range\040oceanographic\040survey\054\040autonomous\040docking\054\040and\040shallow\055water\040mine\040countermeasures\040requires\040improving\040the\040vehicles\047\040maneuvering\040precision\040and\040battery\040life\056\040These\040goals\040can\040be\040achieved\040through\040the\040improvement\040of\040the\040vehicle\040control\040system\056\040A\040vehicle\040dynamics\040model\040based\040on\040a\040combination\040of\040theory\040and\040empirical\040data\040would\040provide\040an\040efficient\040platform\040for\040vehicle\040control\040system\040development\054\040and\040an\040alternative\040to\040the\040typical\040trial\055and\055error\040method\040of\040vehicle\040control\040system\040field\040tuning\056\040As\040there\040exists\040no\040standard\040procedure\040for\040vehicle\040modeling\040in\040industry\054\040the\040simulation\040of\040each\040vehicle\040system\040represents\040a\040new\040challenge\056\040Developed\040by\040von\040Alt\040and\040associates\040at\040the\040Woods\040Hole\040Oceanographic\040Institute\054\040the\040REMUS\040AUV\040is\040a\040small\054\040low\055cost\040platform\040serving\040in\040a\040range\040of\040oceanographic\040applications\056\040This\040thesis\040describes\040the\040development\040and\040verification\040of\040a\040six\040degree\040of\040freedom\054\040non\055linear\040simulation\040model\040for\040the\040REMUS\040vehicle\054\040the\040first\040such\040model\040for\040this\040platform\056\040In\040this\040model\054\040the\040external\040forces\040and\040moments\040resulting\040from\040hydrostatics\054\040hydrodynamic\040lift\040and\040drag\054\040added\040mass\054\040and\040the\040control\040inputs\040of\040the\040vehicle\040propeller\040and\040fins\040are\040all\040defined\040in\040terms\040of\040vehicle\040coefficients\056\040This\040thesis\040describes\040the\040derivation\040of\040these\040coefficients\040in\040detail\056\040The\040equations\040determining\040the\040coefficients\054\040as\040well\040as\040those\040describing\040the\040vehicle\040rigid\055body\040dynamics\054\040are\040left\040in\040non\055linear\040form\040to\040better\040simulate\040the\040inherently\040non\055linear\040behavior\040of\040the\040vehicle\056\040Simulation\040of\040the\040vehicle\040motion\040is\040achieved\040through\040numeric\040integration\040of\040the\040equations\040of\040motion\056\040The\040simulator\040output\040is\040then\040checked\040against\040vehicle\040dynamics\040data\040collected\040in\040experiments\040performed\040at\040sea\056\040The\040simulator\040is\040shown\040to\040accurately\040model\040the\040motion\040of\040the\040vehicle\056\040Thesis\040Supervisor\072\040Jerome\040Milgram\040Title\072\040Professor\040of\040Ocean\040Engineering\054\040MIT\040Thesis\040Supervisor\072\040Kamal\040Youcef\055Toumi\040Title\072\040Professor\040of\040Mechanical\040Engineering\054\040MIT\040Thesis\040Supervisor\072\040Christopher\040von\040Alt\040Title\072\040Principal\040Engineer\054\040WHOI\040Candide\040had\040been\040wounded\040by\040some\040splinters\040of\040stone\073\040he\040was\040stretched\040out\040in\040the\040street\040and\040covered\040with\040debris\056\040He\040said\040to\040Pangloss\072\040\042Alas\054\040get\040me\040a\040little\040wine\040and\040oil\054\040I\040am\040dying\056\042\040\042This\040earthquake\040is\040not\040a\040new\040thing\054\042\040replied\040Pangloss\056\040\042The\040town\040of\040Lima\040suffered\040the\040same\040shocks\040in\040America\040last\040year\073\040same\040causes\054\040same\040effects\073\040there\040is\040certainly\040a\040vein\040of\040sulfur\040underground\040from\040Lima\040to\040Lisbon\056\042\040\042Nothing\040is\040more\040probable\054\042\040said\040Candide\054\040\042but\040for\040the\040love\040of\040God\054\040a\040little\040oil\040and\040wine\056\042\040\042What\040do\040you\040mean\054\040probable\077\042\040replied\040the\040philosopher\056\040\042I\040maintain\040that\040the\040matter\040is\040proved\056\042\040Candide\040lost\040consciousness\056)
/Keywords (01\040Sep\0402001\054\040REMUS)
>>
endobj
